{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Encounter a vast array of substances, from those inspired by real scientific phenomena to purely imaginative materials, or even ones created just for humor.<br></li><li> Substances are represented as square-shaped graphic objects that can be freely moved and combined.<br></li><li> Players must discover new combinations in a clever and creative way, much like solving a puzzle.<br></li><li> Engage in visual novel-style dialogues with various colleagues as you enjoy the game!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try Creative Combinations Based On Laws</h2>Stand on the shoulders of giants! To create new materials, study existing laws and then apply them in novel ways to discover new methods of combination.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/c637ef4934bf9aeefd75a16c389d7d8f.poster.avif?t=1767475810\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/c637ef4934bf9aeefd75a16c389d7d8f.webm?t=1767475810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/c637ef4934bf9aeefd75a16c389d7d8f.mp4?t=1767475810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactions between substances, not just direct combinations</h2>It's not just about directly combining materials; the fields generated by the substances can also affect the outcome of your combinations. Keep this in mind as you experiment with different combinations under varying fields.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/2a61022351b4e33d53decee0a612c5a2.poster.avif?t=1767475810\" width=678 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/2a61022351b4e33d53decee0a612c5a2.webm?t=1767475810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/2a61022351b4e33d53decee0a612c5a2.mp4?t=1767475810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Report new materials by placing them in the submission slots on the experiment table</h2>On the experiment table, there are submission slots for various new materials that currently only exist in theory. If you create a new material, submit it there to build your reputation and achievements as a scientist.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/f6eb745255908964889002f9e0e19fb9.poster.avif?t=1767475810\" width=660 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/f6eb745255908964889002f9e0e19fb9.webm?t=1767475810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/f6eb745255908964889002f9e0e19fb9.mp4?t=1767475810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Academic exchange with colleagues is crucial</h2>Conversations with colleagues researching similar fields can provide clues for synthesizing new materials. Gain insights from your peers through dialogue, and inspire them with your ideas.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/f34b0b30a4ee4de43d8390196001c49e.poster.avif?t=1767475810\" width=694 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811850/extras/f34b0b30a4ee4de43d8390196001c49e.webm?t=1767475810